.TH LILYMIDI "1" "June 2026" "lilymidi 2.26.0" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lilymidi \- manual page for lilymidi 2.26.0
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B lilymidi
[\fI\,options\/\fR] \fI\,FILE\/\fR
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
show program's version number and exit
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show this help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-\-filter\-tracks\fR=\fI\,REGEXP\/\fR
display only tracks numbers, of those track names
matching REGEXP
.TP
\fB\-\-prefix\-tracks\fR=\fI\,PREFIX\/\fR
prefix filtered track numbers with PREFIX
.TP
\fB\-\-dump\fR
just dump parsed contents of the MIDI file
.TP
\fB\-\-pretty\fR
dump parsed contents of the MIDI file in humanreadable form (implies \fB\-\-dump\fR)
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
The full documentation for
.B lilymidi
is maintained as a Texinfo manual.  If the
.B info
and
.B lilymidi
programs are properly installed at your site, the command
.IP
.B info lilymidi
.PP
should give you access to the complete manual.
